      <div class="n98-gift-copy n98-reveal">
        <p class="n98-eyebrow">The gift</p>
        <h2>For the place you met, the home you built, <em>the city you left.</em></h2>
        <p>Add a name, a date or the coordinates of a doorstep. A personal map is the rare gift that is about both of you.</p>
        <a class="n98-btn" href="{{ n98_configurator_url }}">Design a gift <svg width="22" height="10" viewBox="0 0 22 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 5h20M16 1l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98-sizes">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <div class="n98-sec-head n98-reveal">
        <div class="n98-stack"><p class="n98-eyebrow">Gallery sizes</p><h2>From a bedside shelf <em>to a statement wall.</em></h2></div>
        <a class="n98-link-line" href="{{ n98_configurator_url }}">See it on your wall</a>
      </div>
      <div class="n98-ladder n98-reveal" aria-label="Available sizes">
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:48px;height:60px"></i><b>20×25 cm</b><small>8×10 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:65px;height:84px"></i><b>27×35 cm</b><small>11×14 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:72px;height:96px"></i><b>30×40 cm</b><small>12×16 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:96px;height:120px"></i><b>40×50 cm</b><small>16×20 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:108px;height:144px"></i><b>45×60 cm</b><small>18×24 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:120px;height:168px"></i><b>50×70 cm</b><small>20×28 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:144px;height:216px"></i><b>60×90 cm</b><small>24×36 in</small></div>
        <div class="n98-rung"><i style="width:168px;height:240px"></i><b>70×100 cm</b><small>28×40 in</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98-faq" id="faq">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <h2 class="n98-reveal">Good <em>to know.</em></h2>
      <div class="n98-reveal">
        <details open><summary>Will my print look like the preview?</summary><p>Yes. The preview updates live while you design and is exactly the file we send to print — white border included.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is it ready to frame?</summary><p>Every print has a white border, so it sits beautifully in a standard frame. [FRAME OPTIONS]</p></details>
        <details><summary>When will it arrive?</summary><p>[DELIVERY TIMES AND LAST CHRISTMAS ORDER DATE]</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I return a personalised print?</summary><p>[RETURNS POLICY]</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98-letter">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <div class="n98-row">
        <div><h2>New city editions, <em>first.</em></h2><p>One letter when a new edition or palette is released. Nothing more.</p></div>
        {%- form 'customer', id: 'n98h-newsletter' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
          {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
            <p class="msg">Thank you — you're on the list.</p>
          {%- else -%}
            <label for="n98h-email-{{ section.id }}" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)">Email address</label>
            <input id="n98h-email-{{ section.id }}" type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email" required>
            <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
            {%- if form.errors -%}<p class="msg">{{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages.email }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endform -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
  // Zachte "fade-up" zodra blokken in beeld komen.
  (function () {
    var els = document.querySelectorAll('.n98h .n98-reveal');
    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { els.forEach(function (e) { e.classList.add('n98-in'); }); return; }
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
      entries.forEach(function (en) { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('n98-in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });
    }, { rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });
    els.forEach(function (e) { io.observe(e); });
  })();
</script>
</div>

